#: ../../source/config_output.rst:3 ../../source/config_output.rst:9
msgid "Output files"
msgstr "输出文件"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:11
msgid ""
"``pc export`` writes 3D and CAD files; ``pc render`` writes 2D projections. "
"Both are configured by a section of ``partcad.yaml`` named after the command"
" -- ``export:`` and ``render:`` -- with one subsection per output file type:"
msgstr ""
"``pc export`` 写出 3D 和 CAD 文件，``pc render`` 写出 2D 投影。两者都由 ``partcad.yaml`` "
"中以命令命名的小节来配置—— ``export:`` 和 ``render:`` ——其中每种输出文件类型对应一个子小节："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:37
msgid ""
"The two sections behave identically. Which one a file type belongs to is "
"decided by whichever built-in package implements it (see `Built-in "
"implementations`_) -- ``step`` is an ``export:`` type wherever it is written"
" down, ``svg`` is a ``render:`` one. For a file type no built-in package "
"implements, the section it is declared in is what decides: declare a type of"
" your own under ``export:`` and it is an export type, under ``render:`` and "
"it is a render type."
msgstr ""
"这两个小节的行为完全相同。一个文件类型属于哪一个，取决于实现它的那个内置包（见 `Built-in implementations`_）—— "
"``step`` 无论写在哪里都是 ``export:`` 类型，而 ``svg`` 是 ``render:`` "
"类型。对于没有任何内置包实现的文件类型，由它被声明在哪个小节来决定：把自己的类型声明在 ``export:`` 下，它就是导出类型；声明在 "
"``render:`` 下，它就是渲染类型。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:45
msgid ""
"Whichever section owns a file type, the other one is read first and acts as "
"a fallback, so the owning section always wins where both set the same field."
msgstr "无论一个文件类型归哪个小节所有，另一个小节都会被先读取并充当回退，因此在两者设置了同一字段的地方，始终是所属的那个小节胜出。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:48
msgid ""
"For an ``export:`` type the fallback is history: a package that configured "
"its STEP or STL output under ``render:`` before ``export:`` existed keeps "
"working."
msgstr ""
"对 ``export:`` 类型而言，这种回退是历史遗留：在 ``export:`` 出现之前就把 STEP 或 STL 输出配置在 "
"``render:`` 下的包仍然可以正常工作。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:51
msgid ""
"For a ``render:`` type the fallback is what an export implementation *is*. "
"An export file is one a CAD tool can open as a part or a sketch, which is a "
"stricter thing to be than an output file in general -- so it also serves "
"wherever any output file would do, and a render request for a file type only"
" ``export:`` implements uses that implementation."
msgstr ""
"对 ``render:`` 类型而言，这种回退源于导出实现 *本身的性质*。导出文件是 CAD "
"工具能够作为零件或草图打开的文件，这比一般意义上的输出文件要求更严格——因此它在任何需要输出文件的场合同样适用，而针对只有 ``export:`` "
"才实现的文件类型发出的渲染请求，就会使用那个实现。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:57
msgid ""
"Note that neither fallback has anything to do with which command was typed. "
"``pc export`` and ``pc render`` differ in their defaults, not in the section"
" they read: a file type declared only under ``render:`` is produced by ``pc "
"export -t <type>`` just as well, because the section follows the declaration"
" and not the command."
msgstr ""
"注意，这两种回退都与键入的是哪条命令无关。两条命令 ``pc export`` 和 ``pc render`` "
"的差别在于默认值，而不在于读取哪个小节：只声明在 ``render:`` 下的文件类型，用 ``pc export -t <type>`` "
"同样可以产生，因为小节跟随的是声明而不是命令。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:63
msgid ""
"What the two sections do say is what a file type *is*, and that is worth "
"getting right when publishing a package. Declare a type under ``export:`` "
"and you are promising geometry another tool can go on working with; declare "
"it under ``render:`` and you are promising an output file, nothing more. A "
"drawing, a picture or a report is the latter -- so declare it under "
"``render:``, where it stays reachable from both commands, rather than under "
"``export:``, where it would promise a part it cannot deliver."
msgstr ""
"这两个小节真正表明的，是一个文件类型 *是什么*，发布包时这一点值得弄对。把类型声明在 ``export:`` "
"下，就是在承诺提供另一个工具可以继续处理的几何；声明在 ``render:`` "
"下，就只是在承诺一个输出文件，仅此而已。工程图、图片或报告属于后者——因此应把它声明在 ``render:`` "
"下，这样两条命令都仍然能够到达它，而不要声明在 ``export:`` 下，那会承诺一个它无法交付的零件。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:71
msgid ""
"The short form ``<file type>: <path>`` is the same as ``prefix: <path>``."
msgstr "简写形式 ``<file type>: <path>`` 等同于 ``prefix: <path>``。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:74
msgid "Where the file goes"
msgstr "文件写到哪里"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:76
msgid ""
"``prefix`` is the directory the file goes in, relative to the output "
"directory (``-O``) or, failing that, to the package. A ``prefix`` that "
"carries an extension names the file itself, which is the one way to give an "
"object's output a name of its own. Otherwise the file is named after the "
"object, with the extension the file type declares."
msgstr ""
"``prefix`` 是文件所在的目录，相对于输出目录（``-O``）；没有输出目录时则相对于包。带扩展名的 ``prefix`` "
"指定的是文件本身，这是为某个对象的输出单独命名的唯一方式。否则文件以对象命名，并使用该文件类型声明的扩展名。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:82
msgid ""
"An object whose name carries a ``/`` is written into a sub-directory of that"
" name, and the directories are created on the way. A package may declare an "
"object that way itself, and the objects another file materializes are named "
"that way whether it did or not -- a STEP assembly's components are the parts"
" ``<assembly>/<component>``, a URDF's links ``<assembly>/<link>``:"
msgstr ""
"名称中带 ``/`` "
"的对象会写入同名的子目录，这些目录会在写入过程中一并创建。包可以自己这样声明对象；而由另一个文件实体化出来的对象，无论包是否这样声明，都会这样命名——STEP"
" 装配体的组件就是零件 ``<assembly>/<component>``，URDF 的连杆就是 ``<assembly>/<link>``："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:93
msgid ""
"The separator in a *name* is always ``/``, whichever operating system reads "
"it, so the same command produces the same tree on Linux, macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"*名称* 中的分隔符始终是 ``/``，无论由哪个操作系统读取，因此同一条命令在 Linux、macOS 和 Windows 上产生相同的目录树。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:96
msgid ""
"Every directory an output file needs is created on the way to writing it: "
"the sub-directories a name with a ``/`` in it asks for, and the directory "
"around them that ``-O``, ``prefix`` or ``output_dir`` named and nobody has "
"made. There is nothing to ask for -- the ``-p``/``--create-dirs`` flag that "
"used to draw a line between those two halves of one path is gone, and both "
"halves are made."
msgstr ""
"输出文件需要的每一个目录都会在写入过程中创建：既包括名称中的 ``/`` 所要求的子目录，也包括由 ``-O``、 ``prefix`` 或 "
"``output_dir`` 指定而尚无人创建的外层目录。无需额外提出要求——曾经在同一路径的这两部分之间划出界线的 ``-p`` / "
"``--create-dirs`` 标志已经取消，两部分都会被创建。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:103
msgid "Export parameters"
msgstr "导出参数"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:105
msgid ""
"Every field that is not one of those listed above is a parameter of that "
"file type, handed to whatever implements it. Which parameters exist is "
"therefore up to the implementation, not to PartCAD. For example, the built-"
"in STEP implementation accepts ``comment``, which it places into the STEP "
"file's ``FILE_DESCRIPTION`` header entity:"
msgstr ""
"凡是不在上面所列之内的字段，都是该文件类型的参数，会被交给它的实现。因此存在哪些参数取决于实现，而不取决于 PartCAD。例如内置的 STEP "
"实现接受 ``comment``，并把它放进 STEP 文件的 ``FILE_DESCRIPTION`` 头实体中："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:117
msgid ""
"Every STEP file the package produces -- for any part or assembly in it -- "
"then carries that text."
msgstr "此后该包产生的每一个 STEP 文件——无论对应其中的哪个零件或装配体——都会带上这段文字。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:120
msgid ""
"Parameters may be declared per package, as above, or per object, in which "
"case the object's value wins:"
msgstr "参数可以像上面那样按包声明，也可以按对象声明；按对象声明时以对象的取值为准："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:132
msgid ""
"A parameter can also be given for one command instead of written down. The "
"two that aim a 2D projection -- ``viewport_origin``, which is the direction "
"the shape is looked at from, and ``viewport_up``, which way is up in the "
"picture -- are ``pc render --viewport-origin``/``--viewport-up``, with "
"``--view`` naming the common directions (see :doc:`/cli`). Passed that way "
"they layer on top of everything below, package and object alike, for that "
"run only."
msgstr ""
"参数也可以只为一条命令给出，而不写进配置。用于确定 2D 投影方向的那两个参数 -- ``viewport_origin`` "
"表示从什么位置观察形状，``viewport_up`` 表示图中哪个方向朝上 -- 对应 ``pc render --viewport-"
"origin``/``--viewport-up`` ，而 ``--view`` 为常用的几个方向命名（参见 :doc:`/cli` "
"）。以这种方式传入时，它们叠加在下面的一切之上，包和对象都一样，并且只对本次运行有效。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:139
msgid ""
"Two names are not entirely the package's own, and the request has two keys "
"of PartCAD's own beside them."
msgstr "有两个名称并不完全属于包自己，而请求中在它们旁边还有两个属于 PartCAD 自己的键。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:142
msgid ""
"Every implementation is handed the object it writes twice over, and asks for"
" neither. ``wrapped`` is the whole of it as live geometry, which is what a "
"file of geometry is written from. ``shape_tree`` is the tree that geometry "
"was decoded from, one node per object placed in it, nested as deeply as the "
"assembly goes: each node's ``name`` and ``label``, its ``location`` as data "
"rather than baked into the geometry, what it says about itself under "
"``properties`` (its ``color``, its ``material``, its ``physics``), the "
"``joint`` it moves on where it has one, and on every part its own geometry, "
"decoded, in its own frame, under ``shape``. Both come out of one decoding of"
" each shape, so the second costs nothing an implementation that ignores it "
"would notice. A parameter of a package's own cannot be called ``wrapped`` or"
" ``shape_tree``."
msgstr ""
"每一个实现都会以两种形式拿到它所写出的那个对象，而且两者它都不必去要。``wrapped`` "
"是它作为活几何的全部内容，几何类文件就是据此写出来的。``shape_tree`` "
"则是那份几何所由之解码出来的那棵树，放进其中的每一个对象对应一个节点，并按装配体的深度逐层嵌套：每个节点的 ``name`` 和 ``label`` "
"、它作为数据而不是被烤进几何中的 ``location`` 、它在 ``properties`` 下关于自身所说的内容（它的 ``color`` 、它的"
" ``material`` 、它的 ``physics`` ）、它在有关节时所依之运动的那个 ``joint`` ，以及在每一个零件上、位于 "
"``shape`` "
"之下的、它自己坐标系中已解码的那份几何。两者都出自对每个形状的同一次解码，所以第二份对于一个忽略它的实现来说不会带来任何可察觉的代价。包自己的参数不能叫做"
" ``wrapped`` 或 ``shape_tree`` 。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:154
msgid ""
"``properties`` is a parameter -- with a caveat. A file type that declares "
"``properties: true`` is handed, in place of the flag, an index of what the "
"shapes being written declare about themselves: their ``physics``, "
"``material`` and ``color``, keyed by the full ``<package>:<name>`` of each "
"shape, so an implementation given a whole assembly tree can look up the "
"properties belonging to each node of it. A part and an assembly (or a scene)"
" may share a name, and so a full name: that one is then the part's, and the "
"assembly's own entry is also under its kind and full name, "
"``assembly:<package>:<name>`` (or ``scene:...``). "
"``kinematics.properties_of()`` in PartCAD's ``wrappers/`` directory is the "
"lookup that knows this, and what ``kinematics.bodies()`` weighs every body "
"by. Each shape's ``physics`` is complete: what it states, what its material "
"lends, and the ``mass``, ``centerOfMass`` and ``inertia`` its solid comes to"
" at its ``density`` (see :ref:`properties`), so an implementation writes "
"those and works none of them out. A body made of several shapes is the one "
"thing left to it, and ``mass_properties.of_body()`` in PartCAD's "
"``wrappers/`` directory -- on the path of every implementation -- adds them "
"up. Only shapes that declare something, or have a mass worked out for them, "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"``properties`` 是一个参数 -- 但有一点需要注意。声明了 ``properties: true`` "
"的文件类型，拿到的不是那个标志，而是一份索引，内容是正在被写出的那些形状关于自身所声明的东西：它们的 ``physics`` 、 "
"``material`` 和 ``color`` ，以每个形状完整的 ``<package>:<name>`` "
"为键，这样拿到整棵装配树的实现就能查出属于其中每一个节点的属性。零件与装配体（或场景）可能共用一个名称，因而共用一个完整名称：这时那一条属于零件，而装配体自己的条目还会另外以它的种类加完整名称出现，``assembly:<package>:<name>``"
" （或者 ``scene:...`` ）。PartCAD ``wrappers/`` 目录中的 "
"``kinematics.properties_of()`` 就是懂得这一点的那个查找函数，也是 ``kinematics.bodies()`` "
"用来给每一个刚体计重的依据。每个形状的 ``physics`` 都是完整的：它所写明的内容、它的材料所提供的内容，以及它的实体在它的 "
"``density`` 下算出的 ``mass`` 、 ``centerOfMass`` 和 ``inertia`` （参见 "
":ref:`properties` ），所以实现只是把这些写出去，而一个都不必自己算。由多个形状构成的刚体是留给它的唯一一件事，而 PartCAD "
"``wrappers/`` 目录中的 ``mass_properties.of_body()`` -- 它位于每一个实现的路径上 -- "
"会把它们叠加起来。只有那些声明了点什么的形状、或者被算出了质量的形状才会出现。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:173
msgid ""
"With ``properties: true``, an implementation writing a :ref:`scene <scenes>`"
" that states a ``gravity:`` or a ``medium:`` is also handed that scene's "
"world, as ``world``: the gravity in m/s², and the medium as its material's "
"full name with its ``density`` (kg/m³) and ``viscosity`` (Pa·s), resolved by"
" PartCAD from the package that catalogues it. A scene that states neither "
"sends no ``world`` at all, so an implementation that has never heard of it "
"writes exactly what it always did. What a body displaces of that medium is "
"the ``volume`` and ``centerOfVolume`` each shape with a solid in it is "
"handed beside its mass (see :ref:`properties`)."
msgstr ""
"在 ``properties: true`` 之下，一个正在写出某个写明了 ``gravity:`` 或 ``medium:`` 的 :ref:`场景 "
"<scenes>` 的实现，还会拿到那个场景的世界，作为 ``world`` ：其中的重力以 m/s² 给出，而介质以它材料的完整名称给出，并带上它的 "
"``density`` （kg/m³）和 ``viscosity`` （Pa·s），由 PartCAD "
"从收录它的那个包解析出来。两者都没有写明的场景完全不会发送 ``world`` "
"，所以一个从没听说过它的实现写出来的东西，与它一向写出来的完全一样。某个刚体排开了多少那种介质，就是内部有实体的每个形状在它的质量旁边一并拿到的 "
"``volume`` 和 ``centerOfVolume`` （参见 :ref:`properties` ）。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:183
msgid ""
"A part that states no mass and no density, and is made of nothing that "
"states a density, is weighed at the file type's ``density`` parameter, in "
"kg/m³, or at 2700 kg/m³ (aluminium) where the file type declares none. A "
"part that states its mass keeps it, and the fallback decides nothing about "
"it. That makes ``density``, after ``properties`` itself, the one other "
"parameter PartCAD reads on an implementation's behalf when ``properties: "
"true`` is declared; it is still passed through as well."
msgstr ""
"既没有写明质量也没有写明密度、而且所用材料也没有写明密度的零件，会按该文件类型的 ``density`` 参数（单位 "
"kg/m³）来计重，或者在该文件类型没有声明它时按 2700 "
"kg/m³（铝）来计重。写明了自己质量的零件保留它，而这个回退值对它什么都不决定。这就使得除 ``properties`` "
"自身之外，``density`` 是在声明了 ``properties: true`` 时 PartCAD "
"代替实现去读取的另一个参数；它同时仍然会被原样传递过去。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:196
msgid ""
"It is opt-in because building the index instantiates the whole assembly "
"tree, which defeats the shape cache for that subtree: an assembly whose "
"geometry could have been served from the cache has to be built anyway, so "
"that its children exist to be walked. An implementation with no use for the "
"properties should not pay for that. ``urdf`` is the one built-in file type "
"that asks."
msgstr ""
"它需要显式开启，因为构建这份索引会实例化整棵装配树，从而令该子树的形状缓存失效：本可以直接从缓存中取得几何的装配体，仍然必须被构建一遍，好让它的子节点存在以供遍历。用不到这些属性的实现不应该为此付出代价。在内置文件类型中，只有"
" ``urdf`` 会提出这个要求。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:202
msgid ""
"The caveat is that ``properties`` is *not* a reserved field name, and "
"PartCAD intercepts it by value rather than by declaration: a package that "
"declares an ordinary export parameter of its own named ``properties`` and "
"gives it the value ``true`` will find that value replaced by the index "
"before its implementation sees it. Any other value is passed through "
"untouched, but the name is best avoided for anything else."
msgstr ""
"需要注意的是，``properties`` *不是* 保留字段名，PartCAD 是按取值而不是按声明来拦截它的：如果某个包自己声明了一个名为 "
"``properties`` 的普通导出参数，并把它的值设为 ``true`` "
"，那么在它的实现看到之前，这个值就会被那份索引替换掉。其他任何取值都会原样传递，但最好不要把这个名字用作别的用途。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:211
msgid ""
"``reproducible`` is the third, and it is a field of the protocol rather than"
" any one format's parameter. It is a boolean, it defaults to ``false``, and "
"it says whether this file has to come out **byte-for-byte the same every "
"time it is written**, from the same object:"
msgstr ""
"``reproducible`` 是第三个，它是协议的字段，而不是某一种格式的参数。它是布尔值，默认为 "
"``false``，表示由同一个对象写出这个文件时，是否必须 **每一次都得到逐字节相同的结果**："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:222
msgid ""
"Unlike every other parameter, it is handed to the implementation whether or "
"not anybody declared it -- so an implementation reads "
"``request[\"reproducible\"]`` without first checking that the key is there, "
"and means by it what every other implementation means. That is the whole "
"point of it being here rather than in each format's own list of options: a "
"package that publishes a ``render:`` implementation of its own writes "
"``reproducible`` and it already means this."
msgstr ""
"与其他所有参数不同，无论有没有人声明它，它都会被交给实现——因此实现可以直接读取 ``request[\"reproducible\"]`` "
"而不必先检查这个键是否存在，而且它的含义与其他所有实现中的含义一致。这正是把它放在这里、而不是放进各个格式自己的选项列表里的意义所在：发布自有 "
"``render:`` 实现的包只要写下 ``reproducible``，它就已经是这个含义。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:229
msgid ""
"What it does depends on the file type, and on four of them it does something"
" today:"
msgstr "它具体起什么作用取决于文件类型；目前有四种文件类型会因它而有所不同："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:232
msgid "``svg``, ``png``, ``jpeg``"
msgstr "``svg``、``png``、``jpeg``"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:233
msgid ""
"The projection goes through OpenCASCADE's **exact** hidden-line algorithm "
"rather than the polygonal one. The exact algorithm works from the surfaces; "
"the polygonal one works from a triangulation, which is floating point all "
"the way down, so the same shape meshed to the same deflection comes out with"
" a slightly different silhouette on a different architecture."
msgstr ""
"投影改走 OpenCASCADE 的 **精确** "
"消隐线算法，而不是多边形算法。精确算法基于曲面进行计算；多边形算法基于三角网格进行计算，而三角网格自始至终都是浮点运算，因此同一个形状按相同的偏差网格化之后，在不同体系结构上会得到略有差异的轮廓。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:239
msgid ""
"Every number written into the drawing is also rounded to the ``precision`` "
"the file type claims (ten decimal places by default), and a negative zero is"
" written as zero. Below that precision what is in the file is the last bit "
"of an arithmetic rather than a measurement -- a stroke width that differs in"
" its sixteenth digit, an arc rotated by half a femtodegree -- and it is a "
"diff every time the drawing is produced somewhere new."
msgstr ""
"写入工程图的每一个数字还会按该文件类型声明的 ``precision`` "
"取整（默认十位小数），负零写作零。在这个精度以下，文件里的内容是算术运算的最后一位，而不是测量的结果——第十六位数字才不同的线宽、旋转了半飞度的圆弧——而每当这张工程图在新的地方产生时，它们都会变成一处差异。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:246
msgid ""
"For ``png`` and ``jpeg`` that settles the picture and not the encoding -- "
"the bytes below the projection are svglib's, reportlab's and Pillow's."
msgstr ""
"对 ``png`` 和 ``jpeg`` 来说，这确定的是画面而不是编码——投影之下的字节来自 svglib、reportlab 和 Pillow。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:249
msgid "``dxf``"
msgstr "``dxf``"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:250
msgid ""
"The same, plus fixed header metadata: a DXF is otherwise stamped on every "
"save with the time it was written and a fresh pair of GUIDs, and ezdxf "
"derives the order of its ``CLASSES`` section from a ``set``, so it emits "
"differently per process."
msgstr ""
"同上，另外还会固定头部元数据：否则 DXF 每次保存都会被打上写入时的时间戳和一对新的 GUID，而且 ezdxf 的 ``CLASSES`` "
"小节顺序来自一个 ``set``，因而每个进程写出的内容都不一样。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:255
msgid ""
"It is off by default because it is not free. The exact projection is the "
"slower of the two by a wide margin on anything large, and it is the one that"
" can take the sandbox down: every released OpenCASCADE reads past the end of"
" an allocation in the rejection table that algorithm sorts its edge "
"crossings in (`Open-Cascade-SAS/OCCT#1546 <https://github.com/Open-Cascade-"
"SAS/OCCT/issues/1546>`_), which is a coin flip on an assembly with enough "
"edges. A picture produced to be looked at should be the fastest correct one;"
" a drawing that is *kept*, so that a diff answers whether it changed, is the"
" case that says so. Every image under ``examples/`` in the PartCAD "
"repository sets it."
msgstr ""
"它默认关闭，因为它并非没有代价。在任何较大的模型上，精确投影都要慢得多，而且正是它可能让沙箱崩溃：所有已发布的 OpenCASCADE "
"在该算法用来排序边交点的剔除表中都会越界读取（`Open-Cascade-SAS/OCCT#1546 <https://github.com/Open-"
"Cascade-"
"SAS/OCCT/issues/1546>`_），在边足够多的装配体上这就是一次抛硬币。为观看而产生的图片，应当是最快得到的那个正确结果；而 "
"*被保留下来*、靠差异来回答它是否发生变化的工程图，才是需要开启它的场合。PartCAD 仓库中 ``examples/`` 下的每一张图片都设置了它。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:266
msgid ""
"The rest of the built-in file types accept it and write the same bytes "
"either way. They declare it all the same, so that an implementation which "
"starts reading it does not also have to start receiving it."
msgstr ""
"其余内置文件类型接受这个字段，但无论取值如何都写出相同的字节。它们仍然一律声明它，这样当某个实现开始读取它时，就不必同时还要解决如何收到它的问题。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:270
msgid ""
"What it is not is a promise that two machines produce one file. It removes "
"everything PartCAD chooses -- which algorithm, how a number is written, the "
"clock, the GUIDs, the iteration order of a ``set`` -- and what is left is "
"the CAD kernel's own arithmetic. Two platforms that disagree about a "
"transcendental function in the last bit can still find one intersection more"
" than each other along a curved silhouette, and no amount of rounding makes "
"those two drawings the same file. So two renders on one machine are the same"
" file, and two machines agree on everything but the hardest subjects. That "
"is why PartCAD's own ``Examples (PartCAD)`` job compares the checked-in "
"drawings on one cell of its matrix rather than on all of them."
msgstr ""
"它并不是在承诺两台机器会产生同一个文件。它消除的是一切由 PartCAD 决定的东西——用哪种算法、数字如何书写、时钟、GUID、``set`` "
"的迭代顺序——剩下的则是 CAD "
"内核自己的算术。两个平台若对某个超越函数的最后一位有分歧，沿着弯曲的轮廓仍然可能比对方多找出一个交点，再怎么取整也无法让这两张工程图成为同一个文件。因此，同一台机器上的两次渲染会得到同一个文件，而两台机器则在除最棘手的对象之外的一切上保持一致。这就是为什么"
" PartCAD 自己的 ``Examples (PartCAD)`` 作业只在矩阵的一个单元上比对签入的工程图，而不是在所有单元上比对。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:282
msgid "Custom implementations"
msgstr "自定义实现"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:284
msgid ""
"Declaring ``path`` for a file type replaces the implementation itself with a"
" script the package supplies. This is the same mechanism as a ``partType`` "
"wrapper: the script runs inside a PartCAD sandbox, so it may import OCP, "
"build123d or CadQuery, and it is executed with two globals available --"
msgstr ""
"为某个文件类型声明 ``path``，会用包提供的脚本替换掉实现本身。这与 ``partType`` 包装器是同一套机制：脚本在 PartCAD "
"沙箱中运行，因此可以导入 OCP、build123d 或 CadQuery，执行时有两个全局变量可用——"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:289
msgid ""
"``request`` -- the shape in ``request[\"wrapped\"]``, every export parameter"
" the configuration resolved to, ``shape_name``, ``shape_kind`` and "
"``shape_type`` describing the object being written, and ``cache_dir``: a "
"directory belonging to the implementing package, in which a script may keep "
"what it downloads on first use (a converter pip cannot install, for one). It"
" is not part of what the output is keyed on"
msgstr ""
"``request`` -- 形状位于 ``request[\"wrapped\"]`` 中，还有配置解析得到的每一个导出参数、描述所写对象的 "
"``shape_name`` 、 ``shape_kind`` 和 ``shape_type`` ，以及 ``cache_dir`` "
"：一个属于实现包的目录，脚本可以把它首次使用时下载的东西存放在那里（比如一个 pip 装不上的转换器）。它不属于输出缓存键的组成部分"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:295
msgid "``path`` -- the absolute path of the file to write"
msgstr "``path`` ——要写入的文件的绝对路径"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:297
msgid "-- and reports what happened either by setting a global ``output``:"
msgstr "——而它通过设置全局变量 ``output`` 来报告结果："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:305
msgid ""
"or by defining a function that returns the same thing, which is what lets "
"one implementation reuse another:"
msgstr "也可以定义一个返回同样内容的函数，这正是一个实现能够复用另一个实现的原因："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:314
msgid ""
"``files`` is what the implementation wrote besides ``path``, as paths "
"relative to the directory ``path`` is in -- the meshes a URDF file names, "
"the ``.bin`` beside a ``.gltf`` -- and an empty list when it wrote nothing "
"else. It is optional, and what it buys is the cache: a file whose "
"implementation says what it wrote is kept, with everything it lists, and the"
" same file asked for again is put back rather than written again. An "
"implementation that does not say is run every time, because a file put back "
"without the meshes beside it would be worse than writing it again. Only "
"files inside that directory can be listed."
msgstr ""
"``files`` 是实现在 ``path`` 之外写出的内容，以相对于 ``path`` 所在目录的路径表示 -- URDF "
"文件引用的网格、``.gltf`` 旁边的 ``.bin`` -- "
"如果没有写其他任何内容，则为空列表。它是可选的，它带来的是缓存：说明了自己写了什么的实现所产生的文件会连同其列出的一切被保留，再次请求同一个文件时会将其放回，而不是重新写出。不作说明的实现每次都会运行，因为一个被放回却缺少旁边网格的文件，比重新写出还要糟糕。只能列出该目录内的文件。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:323
msgid ""
"Name them after ``path``: asked for ``robot.urdf``, write "
"``robot_meshes/...`` rather than ``meshes/...``. The part of each name that "
"follows what it shares with ``path`` is what is kept, so the same file asked"
" for under another name comes back with its companions named after that one."
" Names that share only the directory come back only under the same name."
msgstr ""
"以 ``path`` 为它们命名：请求 ``robot.urdf`` 时，写出 ``robot_meshes/...`` 而不是 "
"``meshes/...``。保留的是每个名称在与 ``path`` "
"共有部分之后的内容，因此以另一个名称请求同一个文件时，它的附属文件会以那个名称命名后一起返回。只共享目录的名称只能以相同的名称返回。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:338
msgid ""
"``path`` is resolved relative to the package that declared it. A file type "
"that no built-in package implements may be declared this way too, and is "
"then nameable with ``pc export -t`` / ``pc render -t`` like any other."
msgstr ""
"``path`` 相对于声明它的那个包解析。没有任何内置包实现的文件类型也可以这样声明，此后便能像其他类型一样用 ``pc export -t`` / "
"``pc render -t`` 指名使用。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:342
msgid ""
"What an implementation produces is cached -- an exported file or a picture "
"whose implementation says what it wrote, an analysis, a route, a simulation "
"-- under a key that includes the version its script reports: a module-level "
"``CACHE_VERSION = <int>``, read without running the script. Raise it "
"whenever a change to the script changes what it produces, and every result "
"it produced before is produced again. Every implementation and wrapper "
"PartCAD ships states one. (Those results are keyed on the Python sources of "
"the package the implementation comes from as well -- see :ref:`caching` -- "
"so for them an edit already runs everything again on its own.)"
msgstr ""
"实现所产生的内容会被缓存 -- 实现说明了自己写了什么的导出文件或图片、分析、刀路、仿真 -- 缓存键包含其脚本报告的版本：一个模块级的 "
"``CACHE_VERSION = "
"<int>``，无需运行脚本即可读取。每当对脚本的修改改变了它的产物时，就提高这个版本，此前它产生的每个结果都会重新产生。PartCAD "
"自带的每个实现和包装器都声明了一个版本。（这些结果的键还包括实现所在包的 Python 源码 -- 参见 :ref:`caching` -- "
"因此对它们来说，任何修改本身就会让一切重新运行。）"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:352
msgid ""
"The file types of one object that are asked for together -- ``pc render`` of"
" a package that declares several -- are written by one sandbox process for "
"each environment they run in (the sandbox's own, or the layer over it that a"
" file type's ``pythonRequirements`` call for), so the CAD stack is imported "
"once for all of them, and only the ones the cache does not hold are written "
"at all. Each implementation is run in it as it would be on its own: in its "
"package's directory, with ``sys.argv`` and ``sys.path`` as it would have "
"found them, and cached, logged and reported as a file of its own. A "
"package's implementations share that process with one another and never with"
" another package's, so an implementation that sets something process-wide "
"for itself -- an OpenCASCADE ``Interface_Static`` parameter, say -- should "
"set it every time it runs rather than count on a fresh process. One that "
"changes nothing about the shape it is handed except by meshing it may say so"
" with a module-level literal, read without running the script like "
"``CACHE_VERSION``:"
msgstr ""
"同一个对象被一并要求的那些文件类型 -- 比如对一个声明了多种文件类型的包执行 ``pc render`` -- "
"会按它们各自所运行的环境（沙箱自身的环境，或者某个文件类型的 ``pythonRequirements`` "
"所要求的、叠在它之上的那一层），每个环境用一个沙箱进程来写出，这样 CAD "
"栈对它们全体只导入一次，而且只有缓存里没有的那些才真正会被写出。每一个实现在其中的运行方式与它单独运行时相同：位于它所在包的目录中，``sys.argv``"
" 和 ``sys.path`` "
"与它本来会看到的一样，而且作为独立的文件来缓存、记录日志和报告。一个包的各个实现彼此共享那个进程，但绝不与另一个包的实现共享，所以一个会为自己设置某些进程级内容的实现"
" -- 比如一个 OpenCASCADE 的 ``Interface_Static`` 参数 -- "
"应该每次运行时都设置它，而不要指望拿到一个全新的进程。一个除了做网格化之外完全不改动所交给它形状的实现，可以用一个模块级的字面量来说明这一点，它像 "
"``CACHE_VERSION`` 那样在不运行脚本的情况下被读取："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:370
msgid ""
"-- how it meshes, and which of its parameters it meshes with. File types of "
"one object that declare the same, with the same values, are handed one "
"decoding of it, and each after the first finds that one's mesh on the shape;"
" a script that declares nothing is handed a decoding of its own. Declare it "
"only once the file written after another of its group has been seen to be "
"the file written alone."
msgstr ""
"-- "
"也就是它如何做网格化，以及它用它的哪些参数来做网格化。同一个对象的那些声明了相同内容、取值也相同的文件类型，会拿到对它的同一次解码，而第一个之后的每一个都会在该形状上找到那一次的网格；而什么都没声明的脚本会拿到它自己的一次解码。只有在确认了“跟在同组另一个之后写出的文件”就是“单独写出的那个文件”之后，才去声明它。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:376
msgid "See ``examples/feature_export_custom`` for both halves of this."
msgstr "这两方面的完整示例见 ``examples/feature_export_custom``。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:379
msgid "Using another package's implementation"
msgstr "使用其他包的实现"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:381
msgid ""
"``pc export -e <package>`` (and ``pc render -e <package>``) reads the "
"``export:``/``render:`` sections of a further package on top of the built-in"
" ones, so an implementation declared in one package can be applied to the "
"objects of another without that package knowing about it:"
msgstr ""
"``pc export -e <package>`` （以及 ``pc render -e <package>``）会在内置小节之上再读取另一个包的 "
"``export:`` / ``render:`` 小节，这样在某个包中声明的实现就可以用在另一个包的对象上，而后者对此一无所知："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:390
msgid ""
"That is one command's worth of it. To have a package's own output written "
"that way every time, declare the file type and say where the implementation "
"lives: ``package`` names the package, ``path`` the script inside it. The "
"implementing package is fetched like any other dependency, and its "
"``pythonRequirements`` are installed into the sandbox before its "
"implementation runs, so nothing has to be installed by hand:"
msgstr ""
"这只够用在一条命令上。若要让包自己的输出每次都这样写出，就声明该文件类型并说明实现在哪里：``package`` 指明包，``path`` "
"指明包内的脚本。提供实现的包会像其他依赖一样被获取，它的 ``pythonRequirements`` "
"会在它的实现运行之前安装进沙箱，因此无需手工安装任何东西："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:412
msgid ""
"``examples/feature_render_custom`` is exactly this: three file types drawn "
"by an implementation published in the public index."
msgstr "``examples/feature_render_custom`` 正是如此：三种文件类型由公共索引中发布的一个实现来绘制。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:415
msgid ""
"The sandbox comes with the implementation rather than from the package "
"asking for the file. Both ``pythonVersion`` and ``pythonRequirements`` are "
"read from the implementing package -- from the file type as *that* package "
"declares it, or from the package itself -- and from nowhere else. It could "
"not be otherwise: the caller may be a package of STEP files with no Python "
"in it at all, and it has never heard of what that script imports. Where the "
"implementing package declares no interpreter, it is a fixed default rather "
"than whichever one PartCAD itself is running on, which would otherwise "
"scatter the sandbox across versions depending on how PartCAD was installed."
msgstr ""
"沙箱随实现而来，而不是来自请求该文件的那个包。``pythonVersion`` 和 ``pythonRequirements`` "
"都只从提供实现的包读取——从 *那个* 包所声明的文件类型中读取，或者从该包本身读取——别无他处。只能如此：调用方可能是一个全是 STEP "
"文件、里面完全没有 Python 的包，它根本不知道那个脚本导入了什么。当提供实现的包没有声明解释器时，用的是一个固定的默认值，而不是 PartCAD "
"自身正在运行的那个版本；否则沙箱就会随 PartCAD 的安装方式不同而散落在各个版本上。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:425
msgid ""
"Both fields still parse anywhere -- every field of a file type layers the "
"same way -- so setting them on a file type whose implementation lives "
"elsewhere is not an error. It simply describes nothing: the environment "
"being described belongs to the package that wrote the script."
msgstr ""
"这两个字段在任何地方仍然都能被解析——文件类型的每个字段都以同样的方式分层——因此在一个实现位于别处的文件类型上设置它们并不是错误。只不过它什么也没有描述：被描述的那个环境属于写出该脚本的包。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:430
msgid ""
"Every sandbox already holds build123d and the OCP build it depends on, "
"``cadquery-ocp-novtk``, which is the one to name for a script that imports "
"``OCP`` and not CadQuery. Whatever an implementation asks for beyond that is"
" installed into a layer over the sandbox -- an environment of its own that "
"sees everything the sandbox holds -- shared by every implementation and "
"every part asking for the same packages. ``cadquery-ocp``, the OCP build "
"CadQuery needs, is one of those: the two builds write the same native "
"module, so they cannot share an environment, and naming CadQuery's without "
"importing CadQuery gets a script a layer carrying VTK that it never uses."
msgstr ""
"每一个沙箱里本来就有 build123d 以及它所依赖的那个 OCP 构建 ``cadquery-ocp-novtk`` ，对于一个导入 ``OCP``"
" 而不导入 CadQuery 的脚本，该指名的就是它。除此之外实现所要求的任何东西，都会被安装到叠在沙箱之上的一层里 -- "
"一个自己的环境，它能看到沙箱里的一切 -- 并由每一个要求同样这些包的实现和零件共享。``cadquery-ocp`` ，也就是 CadQuery "
"所需要的那个 OCP 构建，就是其中之一：这两个构建写出的是同一个原生模块，所以它们无法共享一个环境，而在不导入 CadQuery 的情况下指名 "
"CadQuery 的那一个，只会让脚本得到一层带着它根本不用的 VTK 的环境。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:441
msgid "Bringing dependencies pip cannot install"
msgstr "引入 pip 无法安装的依赖"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:443
msgid ""
"A Python sandbox can bring whatever pip can install, which is not "
"everything. A native executable is not a Python package at all, and some "
"Python packages publish no wheel for some platforms -- gmsh publishes none "
"for 64-bit ARM Linux and no source distribution either. A package that needs"
" one of those names an image of its own, and PartCAD builds the ``docker`` "
"sandbox from that image instead of from its own:"
msgstr ""
"Python 沙箱可以引入 pip 能安装的任何东西，但那并不是全部。原生可执行文件根本不是 Python 包，而有些 Python 包不为某些平台发布"
" wheel——gmsh 就不为 64 位 ARM Linux 发布 wheel，也不发布源码分发包。需要这类依赖的包可以指定自己的镜像，PartCAD"
" 便会从该镜像而不是从自己的镜像构建 ``docker`` 沙箱："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:454
msgid ""
"``dockerImage`` is read wherever ``pythonVersion`` is -- on the package, on "
"a part or sketch that runs a script, on a provider, and on a file type in "
"``export:``, ``render:``, ``cam:`` or ``cae:``:"
msgstr ""
"凡是读取 ``pythonVersion`` 的地方都会读取 ``dockerImage`` ——包上、运行脚本的零件或草图上、提供方上，以及 "
"``export:``、 ``render:``、 ``cam:`` 或 ``cae:`` 中的文件类型上："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:466
msgid ""
"Like ``pythonVersion`` and ``pythonRequirements``, it is read from the "
"*implementing* package and from nowhere else, for the same reason: which "
"environment a script needs is known only to whoever wrote it."
msgstr ""
"与 ``pythonVersion`` 和 ``pythonRequirements`` 一样，它只从 *提供实现的* "
"那个包读取，别无他处，理由也相同：一个脚本需要什么环境，只有写它的人知道。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:470
msgid ""
"The image is a **runtime, not a delivery mechanism**. PartCAD mounts the "
"package tree into it at run time, so a user who fetches a newer version of "
"your package gets that version and not one baked into an image months ago. "
"An image that carries the package's own code will be serving stale code the "
"first time anybody updates."
msgstr ""
"镜像是 **运行时，而不是交付手段**。PartCAD "
"会在运行时把包树挂载进去，因此获取了你的包的较新版本的用户拿到的就是那个版本，而不是几个月前烤进镜像里的版本。如果镜像里带着包自己的代码，那么任何人第一次更新之后，它提供的就是过时的代码。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:476
msgid ""
"**Declaring an image does not excuse declaring requirements.** A "
"``dockerImage`` says where this runs *best*; it does not say where this runs"
" at all. Every package that names one still declares the complete "
"``pythonRequirements`` (or a ``requirements.txt``), so that the same package"
" works in a ``conda`` or ``venv`` sandbox on a host that already has the "
"non-Python pieces installed -- a workstation with ``ccx`` on its ``PATH``, a"
" CI runner where the job installed them. What the image is for is everything"
" pip cannot supply. What happens where neither is satisfied is an ordinary "
"failure, reported with whatever the implementation said was missing."
msgstr ""
"**声明了镜像并不能免除声明依赖。** ``dockerImage`` 说的是这东西在哪里运行得 "
"*最好*，而不是它到底能在哪里运行。每个指定了镜像的包仍然要声明完整的 ``pythonRequirements`` （或一份 "
"``requirements.txt``），这样同一个包在已经装好非 Python 部分的主机上，也能在 ``conda`` 或 ``venv`` "
"沙箱中工作——比如 ``PATH`` 上有 ``ccx`` 的工作站，或者由作业装好了这些依赖的 CI 运行器。镜像的用途是提供 pip "
"无法提供的一切。两者都不满足时，就是一次普通的失败，并附上实现所报告的缺失内容。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:486
msgid ""
"The same holds where the image simply cannot be pulled -- an offline "
"machine, a firewall, a registry that has not been logged in to. PartCAD says"
" so once and falls back to its own base image, because \"runs best here\" is"
" not \"runs only here\"; the package's requirements are then the whole of "
"what it gets, which is exactly the case the paragraph above is about."
msgstr ""
"镜像根本拉不下来时也是如此——离线的机器、防火墙、尚未登录的镜像仓库。PartCAD "
"会提示一次，然后回退到自己的基础镜像，因为“在这里运行得最好”不等于“只能在这里运行”；此时包声明的依赖就是它得到的全部，而这正是上一段所讲的情形。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:492
msgid ""
"**The declared image is part of what a shape is cached under.** An image is "
"named precisely for what pip cannot install, so two images carrying the same"
" interpreter and the same wheels are still two different native stacks. "
"Changing ``dockerImage`` therefore rebuilds the shapes that were produced "
"under the old one rather than handing back what it built."
msgstr ""
"**所声明的镜像是形状缓存键的一部分。** 指名镜像恰恰是为了 pip 装不上的那些东西，因此两个携带相同解释器和相同 wheel "
"的镜像，仍然是两套不同的原生栈。所以修改 ``dockerImage`` 会重新构建此前在旧镜像之下产生的那些形状，而不是把它构建出来的东西交回来。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:498
msgid ""
"What is keyed is the *declaration*, never the image a sandbox ended up "
"running. Every sandbox type is expected to produce the same result from the "
"same declaration, so a shape -- or an analysis, a route or a simulation of "
"it -- that a ``conda`` sandbox produced is found again from ``docker``, "
"``remote`` or ``venv``, and the other way round. Falling back to PartCAD's "
"own image, or installing the requirements on a machine with no container "
"runtime, keys exactly as the image it stands in for; PartCAD's own base "
"image, whose tag carries the release and the architecture, is never in a key"
" at all. A package that declares no image keys exactly as it did before "
"there was such a thing as an image."
msgstr ""
"被纳入缓存键的是那条 *声明*，而绝不是某个沙箱最终运行的那个镜像。每一种沙箱类型都应当从同一条声明产出相同的结果，所以由 ``conda`` "
"沙箱产出的形状 -- 或者对它的某项分析、某条加工路径、某次仿真 -- 从 ``docker`` 、 ``remote`` 或 ``venv`` "
"都能再次找到，反之亦然。退回到 PartCAD 自己的镜像，或者在没有容器运行时的机器上安装那些依赖要求，其缓存键与它所替代的那个镜像完全一样；而 "
"PartCAD 自己的基础镜像（它的标签带有发布版本和架构）根本就不会出现在任何缓存键里。没有声明镜像的包，其缓存键与还不存在镜像这回事的时候完全一样。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:512
msgid "Architecture, and the name PartCAD actually pulls"
msgstr "体系结构，以及 PartCAD 实际拉取的名称"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:514
msgid ""
"PartCAD appends the architecture of the machine to the name before pulling "
"it, so the name above is pulled as::"
msgstr "PartCAD 在拉取之前会把机器的体系结构追加到名称后面，因此上面的名称实际按如下形式拉取： ::"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:519
msgid ""
"and falls back to the bare ``ghcr.io/example/solver:1a2b3c4d5e6f`` when "
"there is no such tag. One line in ``partcad.yaml`` therefore covers every "
"architecture your image is built for, and adding one later is a new tag "
"rather than an edit to every package that uses it."
msgstr ""
"若不存在这样的标签，则回退到不带后缀的 ``ghcr.io/example/solver:1a2b3c4d5e6f``。因此 "
"``partcad.yaml`` 中的一行就覆盖了你的镜像所构建的全部体系结构，日后新增一种体系结构只是多一个标签，而不需要修改每一个使用它的包。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:524
msgid ""
"Build the suffixed tags. The bare name exists so that a first experiment "
"works before its author has heard of any of this, and a package that only "
"has one is a package that works on the machine it was written on -- which is"
" why the public index does not accept them."
msgstr ""
"请构建带后缀的标签。不带后缀的名称之所以存在，是为了让第一次尝试在作者还没听说过这些规则时就能跑通；而只有这种名称的包，是一个只能在编写它的那台机器上工作的包——这正是公共索引不接受它们的原因。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:530
msgid "Pinning"
msgstr "固定版本"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:532
msgid ""
"Pin an **immutable** tag, whose content cannot change under it -- a digest, "
"or a tag derived from a hash of what the image was built from. An image that"
" changes under a fixed name changes what a part renders as, with nothing in "
"the package to say so, and nothing checked into a repository can be trusted "
"to still mean what it did."
msgstr ""
"请固定一个 **不可变** "
"的标签，即其内容不会在这个名字底下发生变化——摘要值，或者由镜像构建来源的哈希派生出来的标签。在固定名称下发生变化的镜像会改变零件渲染出来的样子，而包里没有任何地方说明这一点，于是签入仓库的任何内容都无法再被信任仍是原来的含义。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:538
msgid ""
"Test against a moving one as well. A package whose continuous integration "
"also runs against, say, ``:latest`` finds out that a rebuilt base image "
"broke it from its own test run, rather than from a user's bug report after "
"it bumps the pin. The two uses do not conflict: what is pinned is what users"
" get, what moves is what the maintainer watches. Anything whose output is "
"compared byte for byte -- the images checked in under ``examples/`` -- pins "
"the immutable tag, or the comparison fails for changes nobody made."
msgstr ""
"同时也要针对一个会移动的标签做测试。如果某个包的持续集成还会针对比如 ``:latest`` "
"运行，那么重新构建的基础镜像一旦把它弄坏，它会从自己的测试运行中发现，而不是等到提升固定版本之后才从用户的缺陷报告中得知。这两种用法并不冲突：固定下来的是用户拿到的东西，会移动的是维护者盯着的东西。凡是输出需要逐字节比对的——签入"
" ``examples/`` 下的那些图片——都要固定不可变标签，否则比对会因无人所作的改动而失败。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:547
msgid "Building on PartCAD's images"
msgstr "基于 PartCAD 的镜像构建"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:549
msgid ""
"PartCAD publishes a base image per supported Python version and "
"architecture, carrying the interpreter and the service that runs scripts "
"inside it. Build on one of those, add what pip cannot install, and the "
"result is an image PartCAD knows how to talk to:"
msgstr ""
"PartCAD 为每一个受支持的 Python 版本和体系结构发布一个基础镜像，其中带有解释器以及在镜像内运行脚本的服务。基于其中之一构建，补上 pip"
" 无法安装的东西，得到的就是一个 PartCAD 知道如何与之通信的镜像："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:562
msgid ""
"``tools/containers/README.md`` in the ``partcad`` repository states what the"
" base image guarantees, what a derived image may change, and how to check "
"that yours still conforms. Carry the ``partcad.*`` labels it documents: they"
" are what ``pc system prune`` recognises, and an image without them is one "
"PartCAD will leave behind when it cleans up after itself."
msgstr ""
"``partcad`` 仓库中的 ``tools/containers/README.md`` "
"说明了基础镜像保证什么、派生镜像可以改变什么，以及如何检查你的镜像是否仍然符合要求。请带上其中记录的 ``partcad.*`` 标签：``pc "
"system prune`` 识别的就是它们，而没有这些标签的镜像，在 PartCAD 自我清理时会被遗留下来。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:568
msgid ""
"An image that is not built on one of those -- a simulator's, a "
"distribution's -- needs a ``python3`` on its ``PATH``, which is all that "
"Debian and Ubuntu install: it is what runs the service PartCAD starts in "
"every container. Say which version it is with ``pythonVersion`` beside the "
"``dockerImage``. An implementation that states none is given PartCAD's "
"default, and under :ref:`useDockerRemote <use-docker-remote>`, where the "
"environment is built inside the container, an image carrying another version"
" is refused rather than used. That environment is built with the image's "
"``python`` where it has one, as PartCAD's own images do, and with its "
"``python3`` otherwise."
msgstr ""
"不是建立在那几个之上的镜像 -- 某个仿真器的、某个发行版的 -- 需要在它的 ``PATH`` 上有一个 ``python3`` ，而这也正是 "
"Debian 和 Ubuntu 所安装的全部内容：PartCAD 在每一个容器中所启动的那个服务就是靠它运行的。请在 ``dockerImage`` "
"旁边用 ``pythonVersion`` 说明它是哪个版本。什么都没写明的实现会被给予 PartCAD 的默认值；而在 "
":ref:`useDockerRemote <use-docker-remote>` "
"之下，由于环境是在容器内部构建的，带着另一个版本的镜像会被拒绝而不是被使用。那个环境在镜像自带 ``python`` 时就用它来构建（PartCAD "
"自己的镜像就是如此），否则就用它的 ``python3`` 。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:579
msgid "What it costs"
msgstr "代价是什么"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:581
msgid ""
"A container runtime, and the size of the image. On a machine with neither a "
"container runtime nor the dependencies installed natively, the package "
"cannot run -- and says which of the two would fix it."
msgstr ""
"一个容器运行时，以及镜像的体积。在既没有容器运行时、也没有原生安装这些依赖的机器上，该包无法运行——并且会说明补上两者中的哪一个可以解决问题。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:586
msgid "Built-in implementations"
msgstr "内置实现"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:588
msgid ""
"The export and render formats PartCAD ships are not special-cased anywhere: "
"they are declared in exactly the form above by two packages that live inside"
" the ``partcad`` installation and that every context can reach, "
"``//builtin/export`` and ``//builtin/render``. They are the bottom layer of "
"the configuration, so a package that sets a single parameter keeps the "
"built-in implementation for everything else, and a package that sets "
"``path`` replaces it."
msgstr ""
"PartCAD 自带的导出格式和渲染格式在任何地方都没有被特殊处理：它们由两个包以上面完全相同的形式声明，这两个包位于 ``partcad`` "
"安装之内、任何上下文都能访问，即 ``//builtin/export`` 和 "
"``//builtin/render``。它们是配置的最底层，因此只设置了一个参数的包，其余一切仍然沿用内置实现；而设置了 ``path`` "
"的包则会把它替换掉。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:595
msgid ""
"Two of the other sections ship one the same way: ``//builtin/cam`` declares "
"the ``gcode`` file type ``pc cam`` writes (see :ref:`pc cam <cam>`), and "
"``//builtin/open`` declares the applications ``pc ide open`` starts. "
"``cae:`` is the one that ships nothing, because PartCAD implements no "
"solver."
msgstr ""
"另外两个小节也以同样的方式各自带了一个包：``//builtin/cam`` 声明了 ``pc cam`` 写出的 ``gcode`` 文件类型（见 "
":ref:`pc cam <cam>`），``//builtin/open`` 声明了 ``pc ide open`` 启动的应用程序。``cae:``"
" 是唯一什么都不自带的，因为 PartCAD 没有实现任何求解器。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:600
msgid ""
"``//builtin/export`` implements ``step``, ``brep``, ``stl``, ``3mf``, "
"``obj``, ``gltf``, ``iges``, ``threejs`` and ``urdf``. ``//builtin/render`` "
"implements ``svg``, ``png``, ``jpeg`` and ``dxf``. Reading their "
"``partcad.yaml`` is the most direct way to see what parameters each file "
"type takes and what a package's own implementation should look like."
msgstr ""
"``//builtin/export`` 实现了 ``step``、 ``brep``、 ``stl``、 ``3mf``、 ``obj``、 "
"``gltf``、 ``iges``、 ``threejs`` 和 ``urdf``。``//builtin/render`` 实现了 ``svg``、"
" ``png``、 ``jpeg`` 和 ``dxf``。阅读它们的 ``partcad.yaml`` "
"是了解每种文件类型接受哪些参数、以及包自己的实现应当长什么样的最直接方式。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:606
msgid ""
"It carries neither ``world`` nor ``mjcf``: an engine's own scene format "
"belongs to that engine's plugin package, beside the reader and the simulator"
" that share its knowledge of the format. Write ``sim-gazebo:world`` and "
"``sim-mujoco:mjcf`` (see `Naming a file type elsewhere`_), which resolve "
"through the plugin."
msgstr ""
"它既不包含 ``world`` 也不包含 ``mjcf``：某个引擎自己的场景格式属于该引擎的插件包，与同样掌握该格式知识的读取器和仿真器放在一起。请写"
" ``sim-gazebo:world`` 和 ``sim-mujoco:mjcf`` （见 `Naming a file type "
"elsewhere`_），它们通过插件解析。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:612
msgid "Naming a file type elsewhere"
msgstr "指名位于别处的文件类型"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:614
msgid ""
"A file type is ordinarily a bare name -- ``step``, ``png`` -- and every "
"package with an opinion about it is layered on top of the built-in one. It "
"may also be written as a full resource path, which names the package the "
"implementation lives in:"
msgstr ""
"文件类型通常是一个裸名称—— ``step``、 ``png`` "
"——对它有意见的每个包都叠加在内置包之上。它也可以写成完整的资源路径，从而指明实现所在的包："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:630
msgid ""
"That is the spelling every other section resolved this way already takes -- "
"``import:``, ``simulation:``, ``pc cae --implementation`` -- and it is here "
"for the same reason: a format PartCAD ships no implementation of has no "
"other way to be reached. Nothing in ``//builtin/export`` is going to write "
"MJCF or SDFormat, so ``pc export -t mjcf`` on a package that never mentioned"
" MJCF has nothing to resolve, and ``pc export -t sim-mujoco:mjcf`` has."
msgstr ""
"其他以同样方式解析的小节早已采用这种写法—— ``import:``、 ``simulation:``、 ``pc cae "
"--implementation`` ——它出现在这里的理由也相同：PartCAD "
"不提供实现的格式没有别的办法可以被找到。``//builtin/export`` 中没有任何东西会写出 MJCF 或 "
"SDFormat，所以在一个从未提到过 MJCF 的包上执行 ``pc export -t mjcf`` 无从解析，而 ``pc export -t "
"sim-mujoco:mjcf`` 则可以。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:637
msgid ""
"The named package goes in as a layer directly above the built-in one rather "
"than replacing the lot, because this section also decides where the file "
"goes: ``output_dir`` and ``prefix`` are the caller's business whoever writes"
" the file. So a package that asks for somebody else's exporter still says "
"where the result lands, and still re-tunes any parameter it wants to."
msgstr ""
"被指名的包是作为紧挨在内置层之上的一层加入的，而不是把整套取而代之，因为这个小节同时还决定文件写到哪里：不论由谁写出文件，``output_dir`` "
"和 ``prefix`` 都是调用方的事。所以，请求使用他人导出器的包，仍然由自己说明结果落在哪里，也仍然可以重新调整它想调整的任何参数。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:643
msgid ""
"``readme``, ``pdf`` and ``html`` are the outputs ``render:`` accepts that no"
" implementation writes: PartCAD assembles them itself out of what the "
"package declares and the images the other file types leave behind (see ``pc "
"render`` in :doc:`/cli`)."
msgstr ""
"``readme`` 、 ``pdf`` 和 ``html`` 是 ``render:`` 接受、却没有任何实现去写的输出：PartCAD "
"自己用包所声明的内容和其他文件类型留下的图片把它们组装出来（参见 :doc:`/cli` 中的 ``pc render`` ）。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:648
msgid ""
"That holds for as long as nobody writes them. A ``pdf:`` or ``html:`` that "
"names a ``path`` is a package saying that this file is one of its own -- a "
"drawing, a datasheet -- and PartCAD produces it by running that "
"implementation instead of assembling the assembly instruction book over it. "
"``readme`` is the one that cannot be taken over in practice, not because it "
"is held apart but because PartCAD ships no implementation of it to replace. "
"See ``examples/feature_render_custom``, where ``pdf``, ``svg`` and ``dxf`` "
"are all technical drawings produced by an implementation another package "
"publishes."
msgstr ""
"这只在无人去写它们的时候成立。指定了 ``path`` 的 ``pdf:`` 或 "
"``html:``，意味着包声明这个文件是它自己的——一张工程图、一份数据手册——于是 PartCAD "
"会运行那个实现来产生它，而不是在它之上组装装配说明手册。``readme`` 是实际上无法被接管的那一个，并不是因为它被区别对待，而是因为 "
"PartCAD 没有自带它的实现可供替换。参见 ``examples/feature_render_custom``，其中 ``pdf``、 "
"``svg`` 和 ``dxf`` 都是由另一个包发布的实现所产生的工程图。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:657
msgid ""
"The package's ``readme`` takes its text from the top-level ``docs:`` "
"section, and its ``exclude`` also takes ``packages``, which leaves out the "
"list of sub-packages -- where a package that depends on the public index "
"would otherwise list the index:"
msgstr ""
"包的 ``readme`` 从顶层的 ``docs:`` 小节获取文字，而它的 ``exclude`` 还接受 "
"``packages``，用于略去子包列表——否则依赖公共索引的包就会在那里把整个索引列出来："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:672
msgid ""
"``docs.name`` is only the title. The top-level ``name`` is the one that says"
" which package this is."
msgstr "``docs.name`` 只是标题。说明这是哪个包的，是顶层的 ``name``。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:675
msgid ""
"``urdf`` is the one built-in file type that is not a single file: it writes "
"a ``.urdf`` plus the directory of mesh files it references, which is why "
"``Shape.convert()`` refuses it (there is no single payload to hand back). It"
" is written from ``shape_tree`` rather than from the geometry, one URDF link"
" per node: the geometry keeps the shape of the tree but nothing else about "
"it, and the link names, the mesh names and every joint origin come from what"
" each node says. See :ref:`sim-urdf` for what it writes."
msgstr ""
"``urdf`` 是唯一一个不止一个文件的内置文件类型：它写出一个 ``.urdf`` ，外加它所引用的网格文件所在的那个目录，这也是 "
"``Shape.convert()`` 拒绝它的原因（没有单一的数据可供交回）。它是从 ``shape_tree`` 而不是从几何写出的，每个节点一个 "
"URDF link：几何保留了树的形状，但关于它的其他一切都不保留，而 link "
"名称、网格名称以及每一个关节原点，都来自每个节点自己所说的内容。它写出什么见 :ref:`sim-urdf` 。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:683
msgid ""
"``svg``, ``png`` and ``jpeg`` read one thing off ``shape_tree``: what colour"
" each part is drawn in. A part is drawn in the ``color`` it states (see "
":ref:`properties`), a part inside an assembly that states one in the "
"assembly's, and anything that states none in goldenrod, ``#DAA520`` -- the "
"colour OCCT draws a shape nobody coloured, and the colour the IDE's Digital "
"Thread draws it in as well. A drawing of several colours is still one "
"hidden-line drawing: a red part in front of a goldenrod one hides it. Each "
"colour is a layer of the SVG of its own, ``Visible`` for goldenrod and "
"``Visible-RRGGBB`` for any other, and a ``color`` that is not ``#RRGGBB`` or"
" ``#RRGGBBAA`` is drawn in goldenrod with a warning saying so. That holds as"
" much for a file type of a package's own that names ``render_svg.py`` as its"
" implementation, as ``examples/feature_interface`` does. ``dxf`` carries no "
"colour at all."
msgstr ""
"``svg`` 、 ``png`` 和 ``jpeg`` 会从 ``shape_tree`` 上读取一样东西：每个零件被画成什么颜色。零件按它自己写明的"
" ``color`` 来画（参见 :ref:`properties` ），而装配体内部没有写明颜色的零件按该装配体的颜色来画，什么都没写明的则画成金菊色"
" ``#DAA520`` -- 那是 OCCT 绘制一个谁都没给它上色的形状时所用的颜色，也是 IDE 的 Digital Thread "
"绘制它时所用的颜色。一张有多种颜色的图仍然是一张消隐线图：一个红色零件挡在一个金菊色零件前面，就会把后者遮住。每一种颜色都是 SVG "
"中它自己的一个图层，金菊色用 ``Visible`` ，其他任何颜色用 ``Visible-RRGGBB`` ；而一个不是 ``#RRGGBB`` 或 "
"``#RRGGBBAA`` 的 ``color`` 会被画成金菊色，并附带一条说明此事的警告。这一点对于某个包自己的、以 "
"``render_svg.py`` 作为实现的文件类型同样成立，``examples/feature_interface`` 就是这么做的。而 "
"``dxf`` 完全不携带颜色。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:699
msgid "Analyses"
msgstr "分析"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:701
msgid ""
"``cae:`` is a third section of the same shape, and it is where an "
"engineering analysis is implemented. Its file types are what :ref:`pc cae "
"<cae>` runs, and every field means what it means above -- ``path`` and "
"``package`` name the script, ``pythonRequirements`` and ``pythonVersion`` "
"describe its sandbox, ``extension`` says what the model file is called, and "
"everything else is a parameter handed to the script:"
msgstr ""
"``cae:`` 是形式相同的第三个小节，工程分析就在这里实现。它的文件类型正是 :ref:`pc cae <cae>` "
"所运行的东西，每个字段的含义都与上文相同—— ``path`` 和 ``package`` 指明脚本， ``pythonRequirements`` 和"
" ``pythonVersion`` 描述它的沙箱， ``extension`` 说明模型文件叫什么，其余一切都是交给脚本的参数："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:718
msgid ""
"Three things are different from ``export:`` and ``render:``, and all three "
"follow from an analysis not being a file type of the object:"
msgstr "有三点与 ``export:`` 和 ``render:`` 不同，这三点都源于分析并不是对象的一种文件类型："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:721
msgid ""
"**There is no built-in package.** PartCAD ships no solver, so ``cae:`` has "
"no bottom layer to fall back on and no fallback section either: an export "
"implementation cannot stand in for one, and a ``fea`` declared under "
"``export:`` is an export format that happens to be called ``fea``. Which "
"implementation runs by default is the user configuration option named after "
"the analysis -- ``caeFeaImplementation``, ``caeDynamicImplementation``, "
"``caeThermalImplementation``, ``caeCfdImplementation`` -- naming a package "
"and a file type in it."
msgstr ""
"**没有内置包。** PartCAD 不自带任何求解器，所以 ``cae:`` 既没有可供回退的底层，也没有回退小节：导出实现无法代替它，而声明在 "
"``export:`` 下的 ``fea`` 只是一种碰巧叫做 ``fea`` 的导出格式。默认运行哪个实现，由以该分析命名的那个用户配置选项决定 --"
" ``caeFeaImplementation`` 、 ``caeDynamicImplementation`` 、 "
"``caeThermalImplementation`` 、 ``caeCfdImplementation`` -- "
"它指名一个包以及其中的一种文件类型。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:729
msgid ""
"**``extension`` is required.** Which model format an analysis writes -- a 3D"
" field, a 2D plot -- is the implementation's decision, and guessing on its "
"behalf would put a name on a file whose contents are something else."
msgstr ""
"**``extension`` 是必填的。** 分析写出哪种模型格式——3D 场、2D "
"图——是实现的决定，替它猜测只会给一个内容完全是别的东西的文件安上名字。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:732
msgid ""
"**The implementation reports findings.** Beside ``success`` it returns "
"``findings``, a JSON array of what it has to say about the part. An empty "
"one is a pass, and is what the analysis checks of ``pc test`` require."
msgstr ""
"**实现要报告各项发现。** 除了 ``success`` 之外，它还返回 ``findings`` ，这是一个 JSON "
"数组，内容是它对这个零件有什么要说的。空数组表示通过，而这正是 ``pc test`` 的各项分析检查所要求的。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:736
msgid ""
"The file it writes is named after the analysis and the scenario as well as "
"the object -- ``bracket.fea.loaded.glb`` -- because a part has as many "
"results as it has scenarios of its analyses. What the analysis is *given* is"
" one scenario of the part's own section -- ``fea:``, ``dynamic:``, "
"``thermal:`` or ``cfd:`` -- which is a property of the part rather than of "
"whoever analyses it; see :ref:`pc cae <cae>` for the keys each takes and "
"what units they are in. An implementation is run once per scenario and is "
"told nothing about the others, so one written for a section of one set of "
"conditions answers each scenario as it always answered the section. Beside "
"the request every implementation is handed -- with a scenario's ``params:`` "
"over the parameters configured here -- the analysis gets:"
msgstr ""
"它写出的文件除了以对象命名之外，还以该分析和该场景命名 -- ``bracket.fea.loaded.glb`` -- "
"因为一个零件有多少个分析场景，就有多少份结果。而分析所 *拿到* 的，是该零件自己那个小节的一个场景 -- ``fea:`` 、 "
"``dynamic:`` 、 ``thermal:`` 或 ``cfd:`` -- "
"它是零件的属性，而不是分析它的那一方的属性；每一项分析接受哪些键、它们的单位是什么，参见 :ref:`pc cae <cae>` "
"。实现是每个场景运行一次的，而且完全不会被告知其他场景的事，所以一个为“一组条件构成的小节”所写的实现，回答每一个场景的方式与它一向回答那个小节的方式相同。除了每一个实现都会拿到的那个请求之外"
" -- 其中场景的 ``params:`` 优先于这里所配置的参数 -- 分析还会得到："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:748
msgid "``analysis`` -- which of the four it is;"
msgstr "``analysis`` -- 它是四项分析中的哪一项；"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:749
msgid ""
"the part's keys, each value in its stored unit: ``fix``/``outlet`` as "
"interface -> instances, ``load`` in newtons, ``temperature`` in Celsius, "
"``heat`` in watts, ``convection`` in W/(m²·K);"
msgstr ""
"零件的那些键，每个取值都按它所保存的单位给出：``fix``/``outlet`` 为接口 -> 实例，``load`` "
"以牛顿计，``temperature`` 以摄氏度计，``heat`` 以瓦计，``convection`` 以 W/(m²·K) 计；"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:752
msgid ""
"``boundary`` -- one record per port a key landed on, with the port's "
"``location`` and the key's value on it, and ``faces``: the faces of "
"``wrapped`` the port covers, each an ``index`` with its ``centroid``, "
"``area`` and outward ``normal`` (planar faces only), all in millimetres. "
"``area`` on the record is their sum;"
msgstr ""
"``boundary`` -- 每一个有键落在其上的端口对应一条记录，带有该端口的 ``location`` 以及落在它上面的那个键的取值，还有 "
"``faces`` ：该端口所覆盖的 ``wrapped`` 的那些面，每一个都是一个 ``index`` ，带有它的 ``centroid`` 、 "
"``area`` 和朝外的 ``normal`` （仅平面有），全都以毫米计。记录上的 ``area`` 是它们的总和；"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:757
msgid ""
"where the part states them, ``force`` on the record of each port a load with"
" a direction landed on -- ``[x, y, z]`` newtons in the part's frame, beside "
"the magnitude under ``load`` -- and ``gravity``, ``[x, y, z]`` m/s² in the "
"part's frame."
msgstr ""
"在零件写明了它们的情况下，还有：每一个有带方向载荷落在其上的端口，其记录上的 ``force`` -- 零件坐标系中的 ``[x, y, z]`` "
"牛顿，与 ``load`` 下的那个大小并列 -- 以及 ``gravity`` ，零件坐标系中的 ``[x, y, z]`` m/s²。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:762
msgid ""
"Those last two are things an implementation has to *read*, and one that does"
" not would pull every load straight down and weigh the part under its own "
"gravity -- and answer as if it had been told to. So an implementation lists "
"what it reads of them in ``reads:``, which PartCAD keeps for itself rather "
"than handing it on as a parameter, and an analysis stating either is refused"
" by one that does not list it, saying which implementation and what to do "
"about it:"
msgstr ""
"最后这两样是实现必须去 *读取* 的东西，而一个不读它们的实现会把每一个载荷都直接往下拉、并按零件自身的重力来给它计重 -- "
"而且答得就像它被这样告知过一样。所以实现要在 ``reads:`` 中列出它读取它们当中的哪些，而 PartCAD "
"把这个键留给自己，不会把它当作参数传下去；于是一个写明了其中任一项的分析，会被没有列出它的实现拒绝，并说明是哪个实现以及该怎么办："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:777
msgid ""
"``wrapped`` is the part with every port's sketch imprinted on it, which is "
"what makes an inlet smaller than its face a face of its own; ``faces`` index"
" it in the order OCCT maps a shape's faces. ``cae_support``, beside the "
"meta-wrapper and importable from any implementation script, meshes it with "
"gmsh with those faces named, and draws a result as the glTF the Digital "
"Thread shows -- the half of an implementation that does not depend on the "
"solver."
msgstr ""
"``wrapped`` 是把每个端口的草图都印上去之后的那个零件，正是这一点让一个比它所在面更小的入口成为一个独立的面；而 ``faces`` 是按 "
"OCCT 映射一个形状各面的顺序给它们编号的。``cae_support`` 位于元包装器旁边，可以从任何实现脚本中导入，它会用 gmsh "
"对它做网格化并把那些面命名好，还会把结果画成 Digital Thread 所显示的那个 glTF -- 也就是一个实现中不依赖求解器的那一半。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:787
msgid "Routes"
msgstr "加工路径"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:789
msgid ""
"``cam:`` is a fourth section of the same shape, and it is where a route -- "
"the program a machine cuts an object with -- is implemented. Its file types "
"are what :ref:`pc cam <cam>` produces, and every field means what it means "
"above:"
msgstr ""
"``cam:`` 是形式相同的第四个小节，加工路径——机器用来切削对象的那段程序——就在这里实现。它的文件类型正是 :ref:`pc cam "
"<cam>` 所产生的东西，每个字段的含义都与上文相同："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:802
msgid ""
"Two things are different from ``export:`` and ``render:``, and one thing is "
"different from ``cae:``:"
msgstr "有两点与 ``export:`` 和 ``render:`` 不同，还有一点与 ``cae:`` 不同："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:805
msgid ""
"**There is a built-in package**, unlike ``cae:``. A route is arithmetic on "
"the object's own outline rather than somebody else's program with a release "
"cycle of its own, which is the test ``export:`` and ``render:`` already pass"
" and a solver does not -- so PartCAD ships ``//builtin/cam``, whose "
"``gcode`` file type is what ``camImplementation`` names by default. Nothing "
"has to be installed for ``pc cam`` to work."
msgstr ""
"**有内置包**，这与 ``cae:`` 不同。加工路径是在对象自身的轮廓上做算术，而不是别人那套有自己发布周期的程序——这正是 ``export:``"
" 和 ``render:`` 已经通过、而求解器通不过的检验——所以 PartCAD 自带 ``//builtin/cam``，它的 ``gcode``"
" 文件类型就是 ``camImplementation`` 默认指明的对象。``pc cam`` 无需安装任何东西即可工作。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:811
msgid ""
"**There is no fallback section.** A route is not a file another CAD tool "
"opens as a part, so a ``gcode`` declared under ``render:`` is a render "
"format that happens to be called ``gcode``, and neither section stands in "
"for the other."
msgstr ""
"**没有回退小节。** 加工路径不是另一个 CAD 工具可以作为零件打开的文件，所以声明在 ``render:`` 下的 ``gcode`` "
"只是一种碰巧叫作 ``gcode`` 的渲染格式，两个小节谁也不能代替谁。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:814
msgid ""
"**``extension`` is required**, for the reason it is required of an analysis:"
" what a controller reads is the implementation's decision."
msgstr "**``extension`` 是必填的**，理由与它对分析而言必填相同：控制器读什么，是实现的决定。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:817
msgid ""
"The file it writes is named after the object alone -- ``panel.nc`` -- "
"because an object has one route at a time and the extension already says "
"what the file is."
msgstr "它写出的文件只以对象命名—— ``panel.nc`` ——因为一个对象同一时间只有一条加工路径，而扩展名已经说明了这个文件是什么。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:820
msgid ""
"**The parameters PartCAD knows by name -- the job: the tool, the depth, the "
"feed and the rest of the closed list below -- are also keys an object may "
"set for itself.** Nothing else is: not the parameters that describe the file"
" rather than the cut, and not a parameter a third-party implementation "
"invented, however squarely it describes the cut. PartCAD cannot check a name"
" it has never heard of against a list, which is why the list is closed and "
"why the paragraphs after the example spell out what is on it. That shared "
"job half is what makes this section and the object's own declaration layers "
"of one namespace rather than two different things:"
msgstr ""
"**PartCAD 按名称认识的那些参数——加工任务：刀具、深度、进给，以及下面这个封闭列表中的其余各项——同时也是对象可以为自己设置的键。** "
"别的都不是：既不包括描述文件而非描述切削的参数，也不包括第三方实现自创的参数，无论它把切削描述得多么贴切。PartCAD "
"无法拿一个从未听说过的名字去对照列表检查，这就是列表是封闭的原因，也是示例之后的几段要逐一说明列表内容的原因。正是这共享的加工任务那一半，使本小节与对象自己的声明成为同一命名空间的两层，而不是两件不同的东西："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:856
msgid ""
"``//builtin/cam`` is underneath both. So a package cutting twenty parts from"
" one sheet sets the feed once, and the one part that needs a smaller cutter "
"says so for itself."
msgstr ""
"``//builtin/cam`` 位于两者之下。所以，要从一张板材上切出二十个零件的包只需设置一次进给，而那个需要更小刀具的零件自己说明即可。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:860
msgid ""
"The object's half lives in ``manufacturing:`` and not in a ``cam:`` section "
"of its own, and that is what makes the word mean one thing. It used to mean "
"two -- the file types a package declares, and the job an object declared -- "
"with the ambiguity managed by keeping the two key sets disjoint. Now "
"``cam:`` is the implementation registry and nothing else, and the job sits "
"where the rest of \"how this is made\" already was."
msgstr ""
"对象的那一半位于 ``manufacturing:`` 中，而不在它自己的 ``cam:`` "
"小节里，这样这个词才只有一个含义。它曾经有两个含义——包所声明的文件类型，以及对象所声明的加工任务——靠保持两组键互不相交来控制这种歧义。如今 "
"``cam:`` 只是实现注册表，别无其他，而加工任务则落在“这东西是怎么做出来的”其余内容原本所在的地方。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:867
msgid ""
"Within the object there are two scopes, and the difference is the point of "
"having two. What is written directly under ``manufacturing:`` is shared by "
"every machine the part names; what is written inside a machine's own "
"subsection is that machine's, and outranks the shared value:"
msgstr ""
"在对象内部有两个作用域，而要有两个作用域，差别正是意义所在。直接写在 ``manufacturing:`` "
"下的内容，由该零件指明的每一台机器共享；写在某台机器自己的子小节里的内容则属于那台机器，并且优先于共享的取值："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:885
msgid ""
"**Each machine takes only the keys it reads.** A laser has no ``diameter:`` "
"-- it has no cutter, and ``kerf:`` is what it removes -- and no ``depth:`` "
"or ``safe_z:``, because it cuts through in one pass and never moves in Z. A "
"drill has no ``depth:`` (how deep each hole goes is the geometry's to say), "
"no ``feed:`` and no ``operation:``. Writing one of those inside that "
"machine's own subsection is refused with a sentence naming what it does "
"take; writing it in the shared scope is perfectly legal and simply not read "
"by a machine that has no use for it."
msgstr ""
"**每台机器只接受它会读取的键。** 激光没有 ``diameter:`` ——它没有刀具，被它去除的是 ``kerf:`` ——也没有 "
"``depth:`` 或 ``safe_z:``，因为它一次穿透，而且从不在 Z 方向移动。钻削没有 ``depth:`` "
"（每个孔钻多深由几何说了算）、没有 ``feed:``，也没有 "
"``operation:``。把这些键之一写进那台机器自己的子小节会被拒绝，并给出一句说明它到底接受哪些键的提示；写在共享作用域里则完全合法，只是用不到它的机器不会去读。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:894
msgid ""
"That distinction is the one a single flat list could not draw. ``tool:`` "
"used to be one key meaning three things, and a cutter diameter written on a "
"laser-cut part was a value silently ignored. It is ``diameter:`` now, it "
"lives beside the machine it belongs to, and on a laser it is an error."
msgstr ""
"这种区分是单一的扁平列表画不出来的。``tool:`` 曾经是一个兼表三种含义的键，而写在激光切割零件上的刀具直径只会被悄悄忽略。现在它是 "
"``diameter:``，放在它所属的机器旁边，写在激光上则是错误。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:899
msgid ""
"Those are the keys that describe the **cut**. A file type's other parameters"
" describe the **file** -- ``//builtin/cam``'s ``units``, ``precision``, "
"``tolerance`` and ``comments`` -- and are set here or by a package rather "
"than by an object. The line is not tidiness: an object's section is checked "
"against a list, a list can only hold what PartCAD knows the name of, and "
"PartCAD cannot know the parameters of an implementation somebody else "
"writes. So a package sets those for its objects, and the closed set is what "
"buys the error message."
msgstr ""
"以上是描述 **切削** 的键。文件类型的其他参数描述的是 **文件**—— ``//builtin/cam`` 的 ``units``、 "
"``precision``、 ``tolerance`` 和 ``comments`` "
"——它们在这里设置或由包设置，而不是由对象设置。这条界线不是为了整洁：对象的小节会对照一个列表做检查，而列表只能容纳 PartCAD "
"知道名字的东西，PartCAD 又无法知道别人所写实现的参数。所以这些参数由包为它的对象设置，而封闭的集合换来的正是那条错误提示。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:910
msgid "Drawing the ports and the interfaces"
msgstr "绘制端口和接口"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:912
msgid ""
"A port is a coordinate frame and an interface is a named set of them (see "
":ref:`interfaces`), so neither of them is geometry and neither shows up in a"
" projection. The four projections ``//builtin/render`` implements draw them "
"when the file type asks:"
msgstr ""
"端口是一个坐标系，接口是一组有名字的端口（见 "
":ref:`interfaces`），所以两者都不是几何，也都不会出现在投影中。当文件类型提出要求时，``//builtin/render`` "
"实现的那四种投影会把它们画出来："

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:928
msgid ""
"``pc render --with-ports``, ``--with-interfaces``, ``--with-all`` and "
"``--with-internals`` ask for the same things for one invocation (see "
":doc:`/cli`); declaring them on a file type asks for them permanently, which"
" is how a package keeps a drawing of its connections checked in beside the "
"plain one. The two add up rather than override: a file type declared with "
"``with_ports: true`` draws them whether or not the option was given."
msgstr ""
"``pc render --with-ports`` 、 ``--with-interfaces`` 、 ``--with-all`` 和 "
"``--with-internals`` 为单次调用提出同样的要求（参见 :doc:`/cli` ）；而在文件类型上声明它们，则是永久地提出这些要求 "
"-- 包正是这样把一张连接关系图与普通图纸一起签入仓库的。两者是叠加而不是覆盖：声明了 ``with_ports: true`` "
"的文件类型，无论有没有给出该选项都会画出端口。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:935
msgid ""
"On an assembly -- or a :ref:`scene <scenes>`, which is built the same way --"
" what is drawn is what the assembly says its ports are: the ones its "
"``map:`` externalizes and the ones it declares (see :ref:`assembly-ports`). "
"Hiding the rest is the point of externalizing anything. ``with_internals`` "
"walks everything inside it as well and places each child's ports where the "
"assembly put the child, so a connection that went wrong is visible as two "
"frames that should have met and did not."
msgstr ""
"在装配体上——或者在以同样方式构建的 :ref:`场景 <scenes>` 上——画出来的是装配体声明为自身端口的那些：由它的 ``map:`` "
"外化出来的，以及它自己声明的（见 :ref:`assembly-ports`）。隐藏其余部分正是外化的意义所在。``with_internals`` "
"还会遍历装配体内部的一切，并把每个子对象的端口放在装配体安置该子对象的位置上，这样出错的连接就表现为两个本应重合却没有重合的坐标系，一眼可见。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:943
msgid ""
"The two flags reach every ``render:`` file type, this package's own and "
"another's alike, along with the ports themselves; what an implementation "
"makes of them is its own business, and one that ignores them draws nothing "
"extra. Nothing at all is collected for a file type that asks for neither -- "
"and never for an ``export:`` type, which is a file of geometry rather than a"
" picture."
msgstr ""
"这两个标志会连同端口本身一起送达每一种 ``render:`` "
"文件类型，无论它属于本包还是别的包；实现拿它们做什么是实现自己的事，忽略它们的实现就什么额外内容都不画。对于两者都不要求的文件类型，则根本不会收集任何东西——对"
" ``export:`` 类型更是从不收集，因为那是几何文件而不是图片。"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:949
msgid ""
"``examples/feature_interface`` declares four such drawings: two of a part "
"and two of the assembly it belongs to, each naming ``render_svg.py`` in "
"``//builtin/render`` as its implementation, in the manner of `Using another "
"package's implementation`_."
msgstr ""
"``examples/feature_interface`` 声明了四张这样的图：两张是某个零件的，两张是它所属装配体的，每一张都按 `Using "
"another package's implementation`_ 的方式，指名 ``//builtin/render`` 中的 "
"``render_svg.py`` 作为自己的实现。"

#~ msgid "Three names are not entirely the package's own."
#~ msgstr "有三个名字并不完全属于包自己。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "``decode`` is not a parameter at all. It is one of the fields PartCAD reads "
#~ "itself -- it says whether the sandbox rebuilds the shape and assembly "
#~ "envelopes into live geometry before the implementation sees them (see "
#~ "``urdf`` under `Built-in implementations`_) -- so no package can declare an "
#~ "export parameter named ``decode``: a ``decode:`` in a file type's "
#~ "configuration is always that flag."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``decode`` 根本不是参数。它是 PartCAD "
#~ "自己读取的字段之一——它表示沙箱是否在实现看到形状封套和装配体封套之前，把它们重建为可用的几何（见 `Built-in "
#~ "implementations`_ 中的 ``urdf``）——因此没有任何包可以声明名为 ``decode`` 的导出参数：文件类型配置中的 "
#~ "``decode:`` 永远是那个标志。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "``properties`` is the other way round, and it is a parameter -- with a "
#~ "caveat. A file type that declares ``properties: true`` is handed, in place "
#~ "of the flag, an index of what the shapes being written declare about "
#~ "themselves: their ``physics``, ``material`` and ``color``, keyed by the full"
#~ " ``<package>:<name>`` of each shape, so an implementation given a whole "
#~ "assembly tree can look up the properties belonging to each node of it. Only "
#~ "shapes that declare at least one appear."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``properties`` 则正好相反，它是一个参数——但有一点需要注意。声明了 ``properties: true`` "
#~ "的文件类型，收到的不是这个标志本身，而是一份索引，记录被写出的那些形状对自身的声明：它们的 ``physics``、 ``material`` 和 "
#~ "``color``，以每个形状完整的 ``<package>:<name>`` "
#~ "为键，这样拿到整棵装配树的实现就能查到属于其中每个节点的属性。只有至少声明了其中一项的形状才会出现。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The file it writes is named after the analysis as well as the object -- "
#~ "``bracket.fea.glb`` -- because a part has as many results as it has "
#~ "analyses. What the analysis is *given* is the part's own ``fea:``/``cfd:`` "
#~ "section, which is a property of the part rather than of whoever analyses it;"
#~ " see :ref:`pc cae <cae>` for how ``fix:`` and ``load:`` are written and what"
#~ " units they are in."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "它写出的文件既以对象命名，也以分析命名—— ``bracket.fea.glb`` ——因为一个零件有多少种分析就有多少份结果。*交给* "
#~ "分析的是零件自己的 ``fea:`` / ``cfd:`` 小节，那是零件的属性，而不是分析者的属性；``fix:`` 和 ``load:`` "
#~ "如何书写、使用什么单位，见 :ref:`pc cae <cae>`。"
